<title>UK: Schroders reports record profits for 1996.</title>
<headline>Schroders reports record profits for 1996.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British investment bank Schroders Plc on Wednesday posted its highest ever pre-tax profits but warned it would be hard to repeat the performance in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;The record results achieved in 1996 will not be easy to repeat in 1997, although there has been an encouraging start to the year,&quot; said chairman Win Bischoff after announcing pre-tax profits of 238.7 million pounds ($382.8 million) compared with 197.3 million in 1995.</p>
</text>
